Alpine on Android by Ooonana
Made with Gemini 3 (base) + GPT-5.5 + GPT-5.6 Sol (final touches)

Working with Alpine packages (apk):
 - Search:  apk search <query>
 - Install: apk add <package>
 - Update:  apk update
 - Upgrade: apk upgrade

GUI desktops: run desktop-manager to install/remove/switch; start-desktop launches the default.
Network: Android passthrough; run android-network-settings to open Android network controls.
